# Workflow: sddra Project

Purpose:
  Workflow state for sddra.ai.

Current Workflow:
  - AUTO chain: analyze → plan → decisions → prompts → update → next
  - Status: Running (idle, awaiting new prompts)
  - Completed steps: analyze, plan, decisions, prompts, update, next

State Transitions:
  - idle → running (on /sdd-<command> auto)
  - running → paused (on NEEDS_INPUT/BLOCKED)
  - paused → running (on /sdd-resume)
  - running → done (on workflow completion)

